      "id": "evidence_text",
      "x": 100, "y": 458, "width": 1640, "height": 114,
      "text": "engine      POST /v1/audio/speech · response_format=pcm\nlevelling   volume_multiplier = 10 ** (dB / 20) · constant per voice\nprosody     rubberband pitch=1.06 · rate=1.12 · preset gain +1 dB\ntone chain  low-shelf +2 dB @250 · high-shelf -1.5 dB @6k · acompressor 2.5:1 · tanh\nmaster      loudnorm I=-16 · alimiter -1 dBFS",
